# Tenancy Hub

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/` before changing C#, tests, UI, or AppHost wiring.
- No em dashes (`—`) in UI copy, docs, commits, or PR text you write; see **Writing style** in `AGENTS.md`.
- Do not add FluentAssertions, Moq, NUnit, MSTest, or TypeScript Playwright tests.
- Use Fluent UI Blazor over custom CSS; see `docs/web-ui-and-css.md`.
- AppHost: register .NET apps with `AddDotnetProject` (Aspire 13.6 Project v2), not legacy `AddProject<Projects.*>`.
- `TreatWarningsAsErrors` is on solution-wide; fix warnings, do not weaken `Directory.Build.props` without explicit request.
